{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0014_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_intro_title", "source_sha256": "868310e193d1af0b9a0a16b18d5826a5490fe3f9410defa30dc115829fc1db4a", "ja": "なし", "zh": "无", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0014_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_intro_synopsis", "source_sha256": "868310e193d1af0b9a0a16b18d5826a5490fe3f9410defa30dc115829fc1db4a", "ja": "なし", "zh": "无", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0014_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_intro_1000_102mis", "source_sha256": "c5de6ad88c11e060c920c4add8d97ad8f096b6b9ca1eeab8d5cbf4f22c2c5b95", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}さん！\nひょっとして、今までお仕事ですか？", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生！\n你该不会工作到刚刚才结束吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0014_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_intro_1001_p", "source_sha256": "ec255a02d79be1560e8f7c1ccd72701733797a9feabb755166907a653865e0f7", "ja": "ええ、収録が押してしまって。\n今戻ってきたところです。", "zh": "是啊，收录时间延后了，\n我才刚回来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0014_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_intro_1002_102mis", "source_sha256": "26b80dbf12e4f95d4dbfda4fdb24b628a52979c2e91e6e94dd36955bc4dded44", "ja": "やっぱり、そうだったんですね……\nお疲れ様でした♪", "zh": "果然是这样……\n辛苦你了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0014_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_intro_1003_102mis", "source_sha256": "cc96ff66a03b640a9c1dee4c0ac422d2b1bbbf70b3df87930ee12751da5ba63d", "ja": "あ、でも、実は社長さんがお呼びなんです。\n帰ってきたばかりで申し訳ないんですけど……。", "zh": "啊，不过其实社长正在找你。\n抱歉，才刚回来就跟你说这个消息……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0014_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_intro_1004_p", "source_sha256": "9c0bc16c41b3be9afe50310b91ffd1a141be338cf0dec619388b3171ac1a33db", "ja": "社長が？　わかりました。ちょっと行ってきますから、\nもうしばらく留守をお願いします！", "zh": "社长？我明白了，我先过去一趟，\n这里就麻烦你再帮忙顾一下了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0014_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_intro_1005_102mis", "source_sha256": "ebde4cc6fbf04093886c5ab349e9b20cda800554f6e2f46105aee70e420a6812", "ja": "はいっ、任せてください！\nお気をつけて、いってらっしゃーい♪", "zh": "好的，包在我身上！\n路上小心，请慢走～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0014_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_intro_1006_null", "source_sha256": "a643276fac463f5e06ddf29dab1f31b8e2c7f7bb284470f7983baf09f788ee39", "ja": "そして……。", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0014_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_intro_1007_p", "source_sha256": "e9096774927b2ce48193e1a5da96640b3c2581b45be71aa2f633e995f5c54e08", "ja": "失礼します。社長、お呼びと聞きましたが……", "zh": "打扰了，社长，听说您找我……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0014_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_intro_1008_101kot", "source_sha256": "c1086599b811644da9d77b68e78548d62459258bedfc5106a81483c15c0e20db", "ja": "うう……。\n{$P$}さん、お疲れさまです……。", "zh": "呜呜……\n{$P$}先生，你辛苦了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0014_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_intro_1009_p", "source_sha256": "0e3ed0555b58e08a3672125624565563f5d4252a88f5aca1a74a51025d3074e0", "ja": "お、音無さん？\nどうしたんですか……？", "zh": "音、音无小姐？\n你怎么了……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0014_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_intro_1010_101kot", "source_sha256": "12d4f59ca6bc5bb4f9cc282cc10989ffacd5c73a01e105b47a76ff925830eaf9", "ja": "実は……大事にしてた本が、\n見当たらなくなっちゃって……ううっ。", "zh": "其实……我找不到\n某本很珍惜的书……呜呜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0014_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_intro_1011_p", "source_sha256": "e1e573bc634f6c6d5ba97a56204116c69b5fd6419bc73bbf9ca9ae732d7bf871", "ja": "そうなんですか？　資料に紛れたのかも知れませんね。\n俺も探してみますよ。どんな本なんです？", "zh": "是吗？说不定混在资料之中了，\n我也来找找看吧。那是什么样的书呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0014_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_intro_1012_101kot", "source_sha256": "d41683c5578a775818e0244da7f84a344d0711cdf86c93fd5866d5b1a38f4ffc", "ja": "えっ。……あっ、大丈夫です！\n自分で見つけますから！　うふっ、うふふふふっ！", "zh": "咦，啊……没关系的！\n我会自己找出来的！呵呵、呵呵呵呵！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0014_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_intro_1013_p", "source_sha256": "dffc6e10b3bbd3a9b02d6ef2913af702050c4be7907e357650f0a0c354d707c7", "ja": "は、はあ……。", "zh": "这、这样啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0014_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_intro_1014_president", "source_sha256": "6791998f124da9657feeb827785e3d77b61cc1a174cb2158ee7862a28244237e", "ja": "やあ、待っていたよ！\n先日のFairy公演のプロデュース、ご苦労だったね。", "zh": "唷，等你好久了！\n之前的Fairy公演，辛苦你一手培育了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0014_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_intro_1015_president", "source_sha256": "5547c8bc2066369497c7b8feb53316be95ce11945154b8e0285c2b5a5af8d2d3", "ja": "アイドル諸君の情熱を感じる、すばらしい公演だった。\n評判も上々で、私も鼻が高いよ！", "zh": "能感受到诸位偶像的热情，是一场精彩的公演。\n不但广受好评，连我都很骄傲呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0014_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_intro_1016_101kot", "source_sha256": "004e0bf1df34e923b518762b278abdf5a5ddb5a89a9f833d915d8353bd77f637", "ja": "そ、そうそう。お客さんやSNSの反応もバッチリで、\nファンレターもたくさん届いてますよ♪", "zh": "对、对呀对呀，观众们和SNS上的反应也非常好，\n还收到了很多粉丝信喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0014_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_intro_1017_p", "source_sha256": "a40c1389b443505de987add2f299f1f098bbf38a78086eb0410f6c32afb028e8", "ja": "ありがたいですね。これも、\nメンバーの頑張りと、ファンの応援のおかげです。", "zh": "这还真是令人感激，这都是多亏\n成员们的努力和粉丝们的支持。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0014_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_intro_1018_president", "source_sha256": "abdc7ef75faa19cebd175a0beed0be7e4a7b5336298df04d4df198681cdc21fe", "ja": "うむ！　そこで、この熱が残っているうちに、\nAngelチームのお披露目公演といこうじゃないか！", "zh": "嗯！这时就该趁热潮还没散去，\n来举办Angel队的首次亮相公演吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0014_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_intro_1019_p", "source_sha256": "59c443dd2e4bde668c19cb97ebe87019e4a75ade5925fd12fa00c8dda881a646", "ja": "なるほど。次はAngelですか……！", "zh": "原来如此，接下来是Angel吗……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0014_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_intro_1020_president", "source_sha256": "dc8ee32d1522907960ea078505831124ef04a36ac0685bbd259409d595dc64c9", "ja": "そういうことだ。そして、公演のオープニングを飾る\n新曲を歌ってもらう『ANGEL STARS』だが……。", "zh": "正是如此。而关于要在公演开场时演唱\n新歌的『ANGEL STARS』……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0014_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_intro_1021_president", "source_sha256": "bcb230e1850e9f54b52791767d8e85173babcc60251d0ebf91748990f3758a7e", "ja": "今回は、伊吹翼君、箱崎星梨花君、望月杏奈君、\n北上麗花君、桜守歌織君の5名にお願いしようと思う。", "zh": "这次我想指定伊吹翼、箱崎星梨花、\n望月杏奈、北上丽花、樱守歌织这五位偶像。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0014_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_intro_1022_president", "source_sha256": "698f2b42f50f245c47efd4e03c2c34aa48f564fa3eddd7be110dacbdd318bcfb", "ja": "公演の采配は、今回も君に任せたいと思っている。\n引き受けてくれるかね？", "zh": "至于这次公演的指挥工作，我也打算交给你。\n你愿意接下吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0014_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_intro_1023", "source_sha256": "c8437da922b05a66a006272ae646cc70f57e96453c9e5b620e3abbd8e90368f7", "ja": "はい！", "zh": "是的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0014_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_intro_2000_p", "source_sha256": "39788d52b6bfce9bc170e104fc9afb58d7a03828b678941ab88dfd8c880388ce", "ja": "はい、任せてください！\nきっと最高のステージにしてみせます！", "zh": "是的，请交给我吧！\n我一定会打造出最精彩的表演！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0014_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_intro_2001_president", "source_sha256": "14e177fcc8d83a76c9cdcffa5a92e547825e7684dd670aed0d291097fafcd217", "ja": "その意気だ！　君とアイドル諸君がどんなステージを\n見せてくれるのか……。私も楽しみにしているよ！", "zh": "就是这份干劲！你和诸位偶像会为我们带来\n什么样的表演呢……我也会拭目以待的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0014_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_intro_2002_101kot", "source_sha256": "a0de0314dfef31bd85c155f6abb1bd872e0d1b7bb6e98b4e1c506da4883ce0a8", "ja": "Angelチームの晴れ舞台、私も楽しみです！\n{$P$}さん、頑張ってくださいね♪", "zh": "我也很期待Angel队的重要演出！\n{$P$}先生，请加油喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0014_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_intro_2003_p", "source_sha256": "47bd4c3704eda338d1936d58e770e08a3ee5ef9e69c9c4e35a43f732d4d3211e", "ja": "（Angelのアイドルたち……。\nFairyとは、毛色の違うメンバー揃いだ）", "zh": "（Angel的偶像们……\n聚集了和Fairy不同风格的成员呢。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0014_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_intro_2004_p", "source_sha256": "424add7a406484d052eb66bb4d28010352761f6e53f96d8bdee80e44ef07c112", "ja": "（新たな気持ちで、\nみんなをプロデュースしていかないとな！）", "zh": "（我也要抱着全新的态度\n来培育大家才行！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
